{"id":"juego","lemma":"juego","pos":"noun","rank":313,"glosses":["play","game; sport","gaming"],"ipa":"/ˈxweɡo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"juegos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-juego.wav","examples":[{"text":"Juego en el campo.","en":"I play outfield.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722113"},{"text":"Me encantan los juegos.","en":"I love games.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438196"},{"text":"No es un juego.","en":"It's not a game.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441914"},{"text":"Nos gustan los juegos.","en":"We like games.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443176"},{"text":"Es solo un juego.","en":"It's only a game.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64183"}]}